      "id": 489336,
      "username": "ahsantareen",
      "name": "Ahsan Tareen",
      "created_at": "2025-12-22T11:39:13.843Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/sfarbod\">@sfarbod</a></p>\n<p>Each Float or Currency fields are programmed to record precision to a 9 level. These precisions can be controlled from <strong>system setting</strong> doctype globally. On the other hand, Process Loss Qty field type is float against which precision can be set to Zero by customizing the stock entry doctype particularly.</p>",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/a/e47774/{size}.png",
      "trust_level": 2,
      "post_number": 2,
      "post_type": 1,
      "like_count": null,
